## 6. Vessel config files

`Config/Vessels/EVA.cfg`:

```ini
ClassName = EVA
Module    = SurvivalPack

Size      = 0.5
Mass      = 120
Inertia   = 1 1 1
```

`Config/Vessels/SurvivalShip.cfg`:

```ini
ClassName = SurvivalShip
Module    = SurvivalPack

Size      = 10
Mass      = 20000
Inertia   = 100 100 100
```

